            "title": "Mowrator",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "items": "Is the Mowrator S1 a robot mower?::No. The S1 is a remote-control mower: you drive it with a handheld remote from a safe spot. It is built for slopes and rough ground that robot mowers cannot handle.\nWhich S1 edition should I choose?::Pick by slope. Mowrator rates the S1 4WD at 75% (37°) on standard wheels, 85% (40°) with Wide Wheels and 119% (50°) with Grip Tread tires.\nDoes the warranty cover commercial use?::Mowrator's standard warranty (2 years or 2,000 hours) is for personal, home use. Commercial, agricultural, institutional or other income-generating use falls under a separate Mowrator contract, so call us before you order for that kind of work.\nHow long does Mowrator delivery take?::Shipping is free on most Mowrator products and usually takes 7 to 10 business days."
          }
