            "items": "Are you an authorized Aiper dealer?::Yes. Yard Automation Pros is an authorized Aiper dealer.\nHow big a pool can an Aiper clean?::Aiper rates the Scuba X1 Pro Max for pools up to 3,230 sq ft, the Scuba N1 Plus up to 1,600 sq ft and the Scuba 800 up to 860 sq ft of flat floor. The EcoSurfer M2 skimmer runs 35+ hours, per Aiper.\nHow long is the Aiper warranty?::3 years on the Scuba X1 Pro Max; 2 years on the Scuba N3, Scuba N1 Plus and EcoSurfer M2; 1 year on the Scuba 800, from the date of purchase with proof of purchase.\nHow long does Aiper delivery take?::Shipping is free on most Aiper products and usually takes 10 to 14 business days."
