            "items": "Are you an authorized Betta reseller?::Yes. Yard Automation Pros is an authorized Betta reseller.\nCan a Betta skimmer run at night?::Yes. It cannot charge in the dark, but a full charge runs it for up to 30+ hours, per Betta.\nDoes Betta work in saltwater pools?::Yes, up to 5,000 ppm salt, per Betta.\nWhich Betta suits an infinity edge pool?::The Betta Flex is the model rated for infinity edge pools.\nShipping and warranty?::Free ground shipping within the contiguous US; Betta usually ships within 1 to 2 business days, with 1 to 6 days in transit. Every Betta has a 1-year Betta warranty."
