            "items": "Are you an authorized HOBOT dealer?::Yes. Yard Automation Pros is an authorized HOBOT dealer, and HOBOT's 1-year limited warranty applies.\nWhich HOBOT is best for frameless glass?::The HOBOT-2S. Its Edge-Leakage Sensors detect glass edges, including frameless panes, and HOBOT says it reaches about 80% of each corner.\nIs a window robot safe on an upstairs window?::Always tie the safety rope to a solid indoor fixture before you start. If the power fails, the backup battery keeps the robot on the glass for 20 minutes while it sounds an alert.\nHow long does the LEGEE-688 run?::HOBOT rates it at up to 90 minutes and up to 150 m² (about 1,600 sq ft) per charge in ECO mode. It vacuums, dry mops, sprays and wet mops in one pass."
